---
layout: base.njk
title: Property Tax Levies (Issues 4-40)
description: County auditor-verified jurisdictions, levy types, and millage rates for the 36 Ashtabula County November 3, 2026 property-tax questions.
permalink: /levies/index.html
---

<section class="levies-directory" aria-labelledby="levies-title">
  <header class="content-page-heading">
    <p class="content-eyebrow">November 3, 2026 · Ashtabula County, Ohio</p>
    <h1 id="levies-title">Property tax levies</h1>
    <p class="directory-intro">Compare what each local property-tax question funds, whether it changes your tax rate, how long it lasts, and the estimated revenue reported for the district.</p>
    <span class="verification-badge">Levy jurisdictions, types, and rates checked against the county auditor on 2026-10-11</span>
  </header>

  <div class="levies-summary" aria-label="Levy summary">
    <div class="levy-summary-card levy-summary-total"><span class="levy-summary-number">36</span><span class="levy-summary-label">property-tax levies</span></div>
    <div class="levy-summary-card levy-summary-change"><span class="levy-summary-number">11</span><span class="levy-summary-label">tax changes</span></div>
    <div class="levy-summary-card levy-summary-renewal"><span class="levy-summary-number">25</span><span class="levy-summary-label">straight renewals</span></div>
  </div>

  <aside class="levy-explainer">
    <span class="levy-explainer-icon" aria-hidden="true">i</span>
    <p><strong>Millage, in plain English:</strong> one mill is $1 of tax for each $1,000 of taxable value. Ohio taxes homes at 35% of appraised market value, so one mill is about $35 a year for each $100,000 of home value before reductions. The “raises about” amounts below are estimates for the whole taxing district, not your household. Issue 10 is a Conneaut charter amendment, not a property-tax levy.</p>
  </aside>

  <section class="levy-estimator" data-levy-estimator aria-labelledby="levy-estimator-title">
    <div class="levy-estimator-copy">
      <p class="content-eyebrow">Make the rate personal</p>
      <h2 id="levy-estimator-title">Estimate it for your home</h2>
      <p>Enter your home’s appraised market value to update the estimates in each row. You can find that value on your property-tax record. Estimates use the full voted rate before credits and tax-rate reductions; your actual bill may differ.</p>
    </div>
    <label class="levy-value-field" for="levy-home-value">Appraised market value
      <span class="levy-value-input-wrap"><span aria-hidden="true">$</span><input id="levy-home-value" data-levy-home-value type="number" min="1" step="1000" value="100000" inputmode="decimal" aria-describedby="levy-estimator-help"></span>
    </label>
    <p class="levy-estimator-help" id="levy-estimator-help">The $100,000 starting value is just an example. These rough estimates are not a tax bill. <a href="https://auditor.ashtabulacounty.gov/dnn/Real-Estate/Levy-Calculator" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Use the County Auditor’s levy estimator</a> for a parcel-based estimate; it also says it excludes rollbacks and reductions.</p>
    <p class="levy-estimator-status" data-levy-estimator-status aria-live="polite">Example estimates use a $100,000 appraised value.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="levy-group levy-group-changes" aria-labelledby="tax-changes-heading">
    <div class="levy-group-heading">
      <div><p class="content-eyebrow">New taxes, increases, or reductions</p><h2 id="tax-changes-heading">Tax changes <span>(11)</span></h2></div>
      <span class="levy-group-tag">Review the change</span>
    </div>
    <p class="table-scroll-hint">Swipe the issue list sideways to see all columns. Expand “Sources and ballot context” for details without leaving this page.</p>
    <div class="levies-table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Tax changes levy table" tabindex="0">
      <table class="levies levy-directory-table">
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">Issue</th><th scope="col">Jurisdiction</th><th scope="col">Purpose and impact</th><th scope="col">Type</th><th scope="col">Rate</th><th scope="col">Term</th><th scope="col">More information</th><th scope="col"><span class="visually-hidden">Worksheet choice</span></th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          {% for levy in levies %}{% if levy.tax_change %}
          <tr>
            <td><a class="levy-issue-link" href="{{ ('/levies/issue-' + levy.issue_number + '/') | url }}">Issue {{ levy.issue_number }}</a></td>
            <td>{{ levy.jurisdiction }}</td>
            <td><strong>{{ levy.purpose }}</strong>{% if levy.notes %}<span class="levy-impact-summary">{{ levy.notes }}</span>{% endif %}<span class="levy-estimate-row" data-levy-estimate data-kind="{{ levy.type }}" data-rate="{{ levy.millage }}" data-existing-rate="{{ levy.existing_millage or 0 }}">{% if levy.type == "additional" %}About ${{ (levy.millage * 35) | round(2) }}/year added per $100,000 home value{% elif levy.type == "renewal_increase" %}About ${{ ((levy.millage - levy.existing_millage) * 35) | round(2) }}/year added per $100,000 home value{% elif levy.type == "renewal_reduction" %}About ${{ ((levy.existing_millage - levy.millage) * 35) | round(2) }}/year lower per $100,000 home value{% else %}Continues an existing tax; not a new charge{% endif %}</span></td>
            <td><span class="levy-type-pill">{{ levy.type | replace("_", " ") | capitalize }}</span></td><td>{{ levy.millage }} {% if levy.millage == 1 %}mill{% else %}mills{% endif %}</td><td>{% if levy.term_years %}{{ levy.term_years }} years{% else %}Not listed{% endif %}</td>
            <td><details class="levy-inline-details"><summary>Sources and ballot context</summary><div class="levy-inline-panel"><p>{{ levy.notes or "No additional note is available for this issue." }}</p><p>{% if levy.type == "additional" %}If approved, this adds a new tax; if rejected, it is not added.{% elif levy.type == "renewal_reduction" %}If rejected, the current 1.5-mill levy expires.{% else %}If rejected, the current levy expires.{% endif %}Check your official sample ballot for the exact wording.</p><ul>{% for source in levy.sources %}<li><a href="{{ source.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ source.label }}</a></li>{% endfor %}</ul><a class="levy-details-link" href="{{ ('/levies/issue-' + levy.issue_number + '/') | url }}">Open full Issue {{ levy.issue_number }} page <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></details></td>
            <td><input type="checkbox" data-worksheet-id="levy-{{ levy.issue_number }}-yes" data-worksheet-label="Issue {{ levy.issue_number }} ({{ levy.jurisdiction }} {{ levy.purpose }}): YES" aria-label="Vote yes on Issue {{ levy.issue_number }}"></td>
          </tr>{% endif %}{% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="levy-group levy-group-renewals" aria-labelledby="renewals-heading">
    <div class="levy-group-heading">
      <div><p class="content-eyebrow">Continue current tax rates</p><h2 id="renewals-heading">Straight renewals <span>(25)</span></h2></div>
      <span class="levy-group-tag">No rate increase</span>
    </div>
    <p>These proposals continue existing taxes at the same rate. A straight renewal does not add a new levy or change the levy rate.</p>
    <p class="table-scroll-hint">Swipe the issue list sideways to see all columns. Expand “Sources and ballot context” for details without leaving this page.</p>
    <div class="levies-table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Straight renewals levy table" tabindex="0">
      <table class="levies levy-directory-table">
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">Issue</th><th scope="col">Jurisdiction</th><th scope="col">Purpose and impact</th><th scope="col">Rate</th><th scope="col">Term</th><th scope="col">More information</th><th scope="col"><span class="visually-hidden">Worksheet choice</span></th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          {% for levy in levies %}{% if not levy.tax_change %}
          <tr><td><a class="levy-issue-link" href="{{ ('/levies/issue-' + levy.issue_number + '/') | url }}">Issue {{ levy.issue_number }}</a></td><td>{{ levy.jurisdiction }}</td><td><strong>{{ levy.purpose }}</strong>{% if levy.notes %}<span class="levy-impact-summary">{{ levy.notes }}</span>{% endif %}<span class="levy-estimate-row" data-levy-estimate data-kind="{{ levy.type }}" data-rate="{{ levy.millage }}" data-existing-rate="{{ levy.existing_millage or 0 }}">Continues an existing tax; not a new charge</span></td><td>{{ levy.millage }} {% if levy.millage == 1 %}mill{% else %}mills{% endif %}</td><td>{% if levy.term_years %}{{ levy.term_years }} years{% else %}Not listed{% endif %}</td><td><details class="levy-inline-details"><summary>Sources and ballot context</summary><div class="levy-inline-panel"><p>{{ levy.notes or "No additional note is available for this issue." }}</p><p>{% if not levy.tax_change %}This straight renewal does not add new millage. If rejected, the current levy expires.{% else %}Exact ballot wording can vary by precinct. Check your official sample ballot before voting.{% endif %}</p><ul>{% for source in levy.sources %}<li><a href="{{ source.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ source.label }}</a></li>{% endfor %}</ul><a class="levy-details-link" href="{{ ('/levies/issue-' + levy.issue_number + '/') | url }}">Open full Issue {{ levy.issue_number }} page <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></details></td><td><input type="checkbox" data-worksheet-id="levy-{{ levy.issue_number }}-yes" data-worksheet-label="Issue {{ levy.issue_number }} ({{ levy.jurisdiction }} {{ levy.purpose }}): YES" aria-label="Vote yes on Issue {{ levy.issue_number }}"></td></tr>
          {% endif %}{% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="levy-sources directory-callout" aria-labelledby="levy-sources-heading">
    <h2 id="levy-sources-heading">Official levy sources</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="https://auditor.ashtabulacounty.gov/dnn/Real-Estate/Levy-Calculator" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">County Auditor levy estimator</a> — issue numbers, jurisdictions, purposes, rates, and renewal or addition categories. Its estimates exclude tax rollbacks and reductions.</li>
      <li><a href="https://www.ohiosos.gov/assets/2026-11-general-qandi.xlsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ohio Secretary of State local questions and issues workbook</a> — official statewide filing data.</li>
      <li><a href="https://lookup.boe.ohio.gov/vtrapp/ashtabula/ballotlist.aspx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">County sample ballot selector</a> — choose your precinct to see the exact question printed on your ballot.</li>
    </ul>
    <a class="directory-action" href="{{ '/sample-ballots/' | url }}">Check your official sample ballot <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  </section>
</section>
<script src="{{ '/js/levy-estimator.js' | url }}" defer></script>

